{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:10.35.030","page_type":"section"},"citation":"10.35.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.030","content_hash":"0761cc5acace33a6ce1a9520992e0e7a51773c520f9f82f6b41b97887accfe87","heading":"Bicycles, electric-assisted scooters, roller skates and skateboards – Prohibited areas.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.030:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.030","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to ride a bicycle, operate an electric-assisted scooter, skate or use roller skates, skateboards, roller blades, or other similar devices in the following areas:\n(1) Public sidewalks and pocket parks in an area bounded by 6th Street and 10th Street along Kansas Avenue; and\n(2) Public parking facilities; and\n(3) Public sidewalks in the following areas:\n(i) N Kansas Avenue between NE Norris Street and NE Morse Street;\n(ii) NE Gordon Street between NE Quincy Street and NW Jackson Street;\n(iii) NE Laurent Street between NE Quincy Street and NW Jackson Street;\n(iv) NE Norris Street between NE Quincy Street and NW Jackson Street.\n(4) Redbud and Breezeway Parks.\n(b) Any person who rides a bicycle, operates an electric-assisted scooter, or uses roller skates, skateboards, roller blades, or other similar devices on a public sidewalk shall:\n(1) Yield the right-of-way to pedestrians and give an audible signal before overtaking and passing pedestrians; and\n(2) Travel at a speed that is reasonable and prudent under existing conditions, except that an operator of an electric-assisted scooter shall not travel at a speed that exceeds 15 miles per hour.\n(c) This section shall not apply to a law enforcement officer engaged in the performance of official duties. (Ord. 20360 § 1, 6-14-22.)\nCross References: Police Department, TMC 2.20.090 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"3f8ee7bc-a5fc-555a-b52e-b3c5c26dec4d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.030","content_hash":"09abf7d568952bfc5caff04ee42e0f6ad74e6645d5614b761bd8d1f48af24f57","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.030:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.030:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.030","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to ride a bicycle, operate an electric-assisted scooter, skate or use roller skates, skateboards, roller blades, or other similar devices in the following areas:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"9e68346d-a5b7-5f42-9aae-4627da204b21"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.030","content_hash":"32c0b1ad85c911c5473ee63e464433db4ad20324b28c50d7159bdcc301b2af92","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.030:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.030:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.030","text":"(1) Public sidewalks and pocket parks in an area bounded by 6th Street and 10th Street along Kansas Avenue; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"8a57c5f5-c6fb-5913-bcea-0e13a953f684"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.030","content_hash":"d2e4e7e33c6cf23b1b8a2a3b387cfb33fb50043a46d1a5f882c13b2ee8a875e0","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.0